WEBVTT

00:00:00.152 --> 00:00:07.277
Create Game lets you choose a public or a private room. Public rooms show up in Open Currents for anyone to join.

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:13.731
A private room needs a join code. Type one in, and friends enter it in Join Game to find you.

00:00:14.384 --> 00:00:19.141
In the waiting room, you set every bot's grade, from F minus up to S plus.

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:24.318
Messages opens the table chat. Type a slash for the two votes, kick and skip.

00:00:25.273 --> 00:00:31.374
Need a break? Surf's Up marks you away. The game waits, and nobody can vote you AFK for ten minutes.

00:00:32.296 --> 00:00:40.339
If a player vanishes on their turn, report them in chat, like P2 AFK. They get twenty seconds to move, or their turn passes.

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:45.291
Click any card to enlarge it, and use the arrows to step through your hand.

00:00:50.497 --> 00:00:54.742
To reorder your hand, drag one card onto another, and they swap places.
